<title>GERMANY: Bonn to issues 2-yr notes, bids due June 18.</title>
<headline>Bonn to issues 2-yr notes, bids due June 18.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bonn government will set an auction for about 10 billion marks worth of two-year Treasury Notes on Tuesday, June 17, with bids due by Wednesday June 18 at 0900 GMT, the Bundesbank said as issuing agent.</p>
<p>The settlement date for the notes is on Friday June 20 and they will be listed on Germaan stock exchanges on Monday, June 23.</p>
<p>The notes will cary the securities number 113678.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
